        <mxCell id="mg-note12" value="&lt;b&gt;Why LLM rerank?&lt;/b&gt; bedrock:Rerank is denied by the org SCP in the only regions offering it, so rerank runs as a scored Converse call (passages ≤ 1,500 chars). &lt;b&gt;Local:&lt;/b&gt; a deterministic fixture provider (hash embeddings, extractive answers) is labelled FIXTURE and refused at startup outside ERP_ENVIRONMENT=local." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=1;fontSize=11;fontColor=#232F3E;spacing=10;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#D5DBDB;arcSize=4;" vertex="1" parent="1">
